      </div>

      <div class="block-display-area">
        <div class="block-group-box">
          <div class="block-group-title">
            <span>📦 원래 전체 수 (${curNumA})</span>
            <span style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#94a3b8;">10개짜리 ${tens}개 / 낱개 ${ones}개</span>
